WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.954
In this video you’ll sign in to Bergeron Maps and open your site.

2
00:00:07.954 --> 00:00:11.630
It takes about two minutes, and there’s no password to set up.

3
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:20.658
Go to bergeronmaps.com and choose Sign in, at the top of the page.

4
00:00:21.109 --> 00:00:24.972
Type your work email, the one your account was set up with.

5
00:00:24.972 --> 00:00:27.329
Then choose Email me a sign-in link.

6
00:00:27.782 --> 00:00:32.478
We send you an email with a sign-in link and a six-digit code.

7
00:00:32.478 --> 00:00:36.416
Open the link on this device, or type the code here.

8
00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:38.083
Both work for an hour.

9
00:00:38.534 --> 00:00:40.575
Choose Sign in.

10
00:00:41.028 --> 00:00:43.471
You’re in. This is the Maps page.

11
00:00:43.471 --> 00:00:46.135
It lists every site in your company.

12
00:00:46.587 --> 00:00:49.223
Here is our example site, Sample Garage.

13
00:00:49.223 --> 00:00:51.134
Each site can hold five maps.

14
00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:56.472
The text next to the name shows how many maps it has, and how many are published.

15
00:00:56.924 --> 00:01:01.706
If you manage just one site, you’ll see only that site here.

16
00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:06.553
Sample Garage has no maps yet, so the next step is to build one.

17
00:01:07.004 --> 00:01:08.787
You stay signed in on this device.

18
00:01:08.787 --> 00:01:12.142
If you’re ever signed out, just ask for a new link the same way.
